-- runtime filters disabled: the probe read as it is, the merge join reads the hundredth of it that the build side covers
merge join
-- the probe under a filter: its keys need not be spread over its range, the merge is charged the whole probe
hash join
-- the build side under a filter: its keys still lie in its range, the merge reads that hundredth
merge join
-- with the runtime filter: the probe read as it is, a hash join reads a tenth of it
hash joins only
-- the probe under a filter: the hash join is charged the whole probe, which is merge-joined with the sorted build side
uses a merge join
-- the build side under a filter: it still bounds the probe, a hash join reads a tenth of it
hash joins only
-- a build side with measured statistics, runtime filters disabled: the merge join reads the few probe keys it covers
merge join
-- the same filtered on another column: its keys still lie in its range
merge join
-- statistics that miss a part: the range need not enclose the keys, the merge is charged the whole probe
hash join
-- a probe with measured statistics, runtime filters disabled: the merge join reads the hundredth the build side covers
merge join
-- the same filtered on another column: its keys stay spread over its range, assuming independent columns
merge join
-- the same filtered on its key: the merge is charged the whole probe
hash join
